      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.04429626464844,
        170.43319702148438,
        245.4136962890625,
        184.8542022705078
      ],
      "text": "(8) children. Second edition, 2014",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiboldItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.04429626464844,
        192.2238311767578,
        505.8674621582031,
        206.6668243408203
      ],
      "text": "Children with pulmonary TB or tuberculous peripheral lymphadenitis who live in settings with",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.04429626464844,
        204.2238311767578,
        498.3258056640625,
        218.6668243408203
      ],
      "text": "low HIV prevalence and/or low prevalence of isoniazid resistance and children who are HIV-",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.04429626464844,
        216.2238311767578,
        518.1752319335938,
        230.6668243408203
      ],
      "text": "negative, can be treated with a three-drug regimen (HRZ) for 2 months followed by a two-drug",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.04429626464844,
        228.2238311767578,
        298.9656677246094,
        242.6668243408203
      ],
      "text": "(HR) regimen for 4 months at standard dosages.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.04429626464844,
        241.6818389892578,
        329.7466735839844,
        258.86383056640625
      ],
      "text": "(Strong recommendation, moderate quality of evidence)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.04429626464844,
        266.09039306640625,
        501.6059875488281,
        280.5334167480469
      ],
      "text": "Children and adolescents with severe pulmonary disease should be treated with a four-drug",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.04429626464844,
        278.09039306640625,
        506.7649841308594,
        292.5334167480469
      ],
      "text": "regimen (HRZE) for 2 months followed by a two-drug regimen (HR) for 4 months at standard",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.04429626464844,
        290.09039306640625,
        121.51628875732422,
        304.5334167480469
      ],
      "text": "dosages.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.04429626464844,
        303.54827880859375,
        338.4692687988281,
        320.73028564453125
      ],
      "text": "(Strong recommendation, moderate certainty of evidence)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.04429626464844,
        327.9570007324219,
        515.0655517578125,
        342.4000244140625
      ],
      "text": "Infants aged 0–3 months with suspected or confirmed pulmonary TB or tuberculous peripheral",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.04429626464844,
        339.9570007324219,
        516.5142822265625,
        354.4000244140625
      ],
      "text": "lymphadenitis should be promptly treated with the 6-month treatment regimen (2HRZ(E)/4HR).",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.04429626464844,
        351.9570007324219,
        493.14593505859375,
        366.4000244140625
      ],
      "text": "Treatment may require dose adjustment to reconcile the effect of age and possible toxicity",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.04429626464844,
        363.9570007324219,
        497.4855041503906,
        378.4000244140625
      ],
      "text": "in young infants. The decision to adjust doses should be taken by a clinician experienced in",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.04429626464844,
        375.9570007324219,
        192.42233276367188,
        390.4000244140625
      ],
      "text": "managing paediatric TB.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.04429626464844,
        389.4149169921875,
        310.3462829589844,
        406.5968933105469
      ],
      "text": "(Strong recommendation, low certainty of evidence)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.04429626464844,
        413.8235168457031,
        494.0600280761719,
        428.26654052734375
      ],
      "text": "Children with suspected or confirmed osteoarticular TB should be treated with a four-drug",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.04429626464844,
        425.8235168457031,
        503.69049072265625,
        440.26654052734375
      ],
      "text": "regimen (HRZE) for 2 months, followed by a two-drug regimen (HR) for 10 months, the total",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.04429626464844,
        437.8235168457031,
        262.7166748046875,
        452.26654052734375
      ],
      "text": "duration of treatment being 12 months.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.04429626464844,
        451.281494140625,
        310.3462829589844,
        468.4635009765625
      ],
      "text": "(Strong recommendation, low certainty of evidence)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.04429626464844,
        475.6900939941406,
        488.46875,
        490.13311767578125
      ],
      "text": "Streptomycin should not be used as part of first-line treatment regimens for children with",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.04429626464844,
        487.6900939941406,
        333.6480407714844,
        502.13311767578125
      ],
      "text": "pulmonary TB or tuberculous peripheral lymphadenitis.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.04429626464844,
        501.14813232421875,
        338.4692687988281,
        518.3301391601562
      ],
      "text": "(Strong recommendation, moderate certainty of evidence)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.04429626464844,
        525.4467163085938,
        512.4309692382812,
        539.8016967773438
      ],
      "text": "WHO consolidated guidelines on tuberculosis. Module 4: treatment – drug-susceptible",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.04429626464844,
        537.3807373046875,
        280.481689453125,
        551.8016967773438
      ],
      "text": "(55) tuberculosis treatment, 2022 update",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiboldItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.04429626464844,
        559.1712646484375,
        508.2896423339844,
        573.6142578125
      ],
      "text": "New patients with pulmonary TB should receive a regimen containing 6 months of rifampicin:",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.04429626464844,
        571.1712646484375,
        141.32546997070312,
        585.6142578125
      ],
      "text": "2HRZE/4HR. 36",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.04429626464844,
        584.6293334960938,
        314.7934875488281,
        601.8113403320312
      ],
      "text": "(Strong recommendation, high certainty of evidence)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.04429626464844,
        609.037841796875,
        487.0122985839844,
        623.4808349609375
      ],
      "text": "In all patients with drug-susceptible pulmonary TB, the use of thrice-weekly dosing is not",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.04429626464844,
        621.037841796875,
        490.0845947265625,
        635.4808349609375
      ],
      "text": "recommended in both the intensive and continuation phases of therapy, and daily dosing",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.04429626464844,
        633.037841796875,
        285.7320251464844,
        647.4808349609375
      ],
      "text": "remains the recommended dosing frequency.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.04429626464844,
        646.4957885742188,
        371.75396728515625,
        663.6777954101562
      ],
      "text": "(Conditional recommendation, very low certainty in the evidence)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.04429626464844,
        670.9044189453125,
        485.90570068359375,
        685.347412109375
      ],
      "text": "The use of FDC tablets is recommended over separate drug formulations in treatment of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.04429626464844,
        682.9044189453125,
        235.81732177734375,
        697.347412109375
      ],
      "text": "patients with drug-susceptible TB.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.04429626464844,
        696.3623657226562,
        349.67877197265625,
        713.5443725585938
      ],
      "text": "(Conditional recommendation, low certainty in the evidence)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
